// Boilerplate property map for Certora review.
// Convert to the exact Certora Prover syntax used by the project.
//
// Properties:
// - setAuditorVerification and transferOwnership are callable only by owner.
// - registerAuditAuto is callable only by owner or a verified auditor.
// - invalidateAudit is callable only by the audit auditor or owner.
// - transferOwnership never accepts the zero address.
//
// Concrete selectors:
// AuditRegistry.setAuditorVerification(address,bool)
// AuditRegistry.transferOwnership(address)
// AuditRegistry.registerAuditAuto(bytes32,bytes32,address,uint8,string)
// AuditRegistry.invalidateAudit(string,string)
